sNew","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T21:32:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685673","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5003880-1842846814440499","game_id":"steam-5003880","kind":"announcement","title":"The New Demo Is Here","summary":"IRON EDEN | Demo 0.0.9.9The New Demo Is HereThe IRON EDEN Demo 0.0.9.9 is now available.This version brings significantly more content and provides a much better representation of the game's core mechanics, systems, and overall direction.The goal of this Demo is to give players a clearer look at what IRON EDEN is becoming.New ContentAdded multiple new items and equipment.Added a new tutorial.Added new enemy types.Added new visual effects and improvements.Expanded the gameplay experience with add","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T14:31:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814440499","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5003880-1842212951300152","game_id":"steam-5003880","kind":"announcement","title":"IRON EDEN | Closed Beta Devlog 0.0.9.8:","summary":"IRON EDEN | Closed Beta Devlog 0.0.9.8: Dash UpdateDevelopment StatusIRON EDEN 0.0.9.8 is now the new Beta build for the Demo.This version represents a more complete and polished vision of the game, designed to provide testers with a better representation of what the final product is aiming to become.Dash SystemThe Dash system has been completely refactored from the ground up.Completely reworked the underlying Dash system.Improved responsiveness and input handling.Improved the overall feel and c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-27T14:06:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951300152","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5003880-1840944183789878","game_id":"steam-5003880","kind":"announcement","title":"Mech Hunters","summary":"IRON EDEN | Closed Beta Devlog: Mech HuntersDevelopment StatusA new Closed Beta build is now entering testing.The next stage of IRON EDEN's development is here. Enemy Mechs are no longer just an experiment in the background. They are now entering the missions themselves.And they are hunting.Mech HuntersEnemy Mechs can now spawn directly inside IRON EDEN missions.Unlike standard enemies, these units operate using a much more advanced AI system and are built around the same core mechanics as playe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T20:49:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183789878","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5003880-1840944183775240","game_id":"steam-5003880","kind":"announcement","title":"IRON EDEN Demo is Now Available","summary":"IRON EDEN Demo is Now AvailableThe IRON EDEN Demo is finally here.After all the work, refactors, testing, bugs, explosions, and probably a few questionable life choices, the Demo is now available for everyone to play. ⚙️Please give it a try and, most importantly, send us your feedback. Every report, suggestion, and piece of feedback helps shape the future of IRON EDEN.Thank you to everyone who supported the project, tested the game, shared it, and stayed along for the journey.Welcome to IRON EDE","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T23:29:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183775240","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5003880-1840944183772970","game_id":"steam-5003880","kind":"announcement","title":"Enemy Mechs","summary":"IRON EDEN | Devlog 0.0.9.5: Enemy MechsDevelopment StatusIRON EDEN 0.0.9.5 is a private Beta Test build for testers.The game is currently undergoing another massive internal overhaul. After extensive refactoring, some of the systems that have been waiting in the shadows are finally beginning to emerge.And this time, IRON EDEN is getting company.Enemy MechsEnemy Mechs are finally being implemented into the game.These units will eventually become a major part of Expedition Mode, bringing enemies t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-12T04:37:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183772970","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5003880-1840310314340446","game_id":"steam-5003880","kind":"announcement","title":"IRON EDEN is officially on Steam!","summary":"IRON EDEN is officially on Steam! 🚀First of all, I just want to say thank you to everyone who has been following the development of IRON EDEN.Seeing the Steam page finally go live is a huge milestone for me. There's still a long road ahead, but this is one of those moments that makes all the hard work feel worth it.Now we're entering a new phase of development: building the community and sharing the journey together.From now on, you can expect much more activity from me, including:Regular develo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T23:57:35Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314340446","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:47Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only